                     </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"1924\" data-height=\"3464\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1924/h_3464/202/63428/2023/2/3/84321.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1924/h_3464/202/63428/2023/2/3/84321.png\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"组队思路\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"岛夫人难点分析\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">1.频繁的8秒重击，</span>让你的前排角色无法正常行动。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">2.自身16秒减益命中率Buff，</span>让你的减益回避率失效。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">3.5体分解伤害，</span>如果队伍缺乏解状态角色会造成减员</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">4.Drive超高伤害，</span>附带5体石化效果<span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(202, 200, 207);\">（开出大招直接团灭）</span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">整体看下来，没有特别好的解法，</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">单靠芙蕾雅提供生存行不通</span>，因为Boss有减益命中率。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">用老板娘或狗哥退条</span>，能解决大招问题，但岛夫人的小技能控制也很恶心。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\">最好的解法：时间停止组合。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">只用两个位置解决生存问题，并且前排不会被控。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div></span><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"角色替换思路\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"常驻干扰\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div style=\"color:rgb(64,64,64);font-size:13.9999px;\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">常驻干扰</p></div><br></div><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605160233313_78519464.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605157796565_47141566.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">两者都无可替代，其中</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(201, 0, 0);\">狼人至少点火3星</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(201, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605161690734_9120736.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(201, 0, 0);\">至少点火4星</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">，若不满足，</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">可用<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605160158572_77287904.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">替代</span></div><div style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"破防组合\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">破防组合1</p></div><br></div><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_248/h_246/202/63428/2022/11/16/464098.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"248\" data-height=\"246\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 63px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535917155_67069371.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">拉姆+泽卡提</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(204, 0, 0);\">最完美的破防组合，</span>其中</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(201, 0, 0);\">拉姆至少点火6星</span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">，泽卡提不需要点火。</span></div></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">如果没有泽卡提，则使用<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1607677056839_7406485.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\">代替（</span><span style=\"color: rgb(201, 0, 0);\">至少点火3星</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\">，且负作用很大，尽量别用他）</span></span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64);\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">破防组合2</p></div></span></span></div><div style=\"\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605160178429_57391278.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: bold; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1605158773314_52661384.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: bold; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1636710038798_99018374.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" data-width=\"250\" data-height=\"250\" style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: bold; width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">破防组合2：</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: 700;\">木伞+甜甜圈+镰刀人偶</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(185, 8, 8);\">木伞需要点火6星</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: 700;\">，</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(210, 0, 0);\">镰刀人偶等级越高越好</span><span style=\"color: rgb(64, 64, 64); font-weight: 700;\">，低级效果很差，注意</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(196, 1, 1);\">把队长换为甜甜圈</span></div><div style=\"\"><br></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"color: rgb(201, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 16px;\">上述破防组合只选其中1组，不可混搭使用</span><br></span></div></span><div class=\"catalog-item-wrapper\" contenteditable=\"false\">\n                              <span class=\"text\"></span>\n                              <input type=\"text\" class=\"catalog-input\" placeholder=\"输入目录标题\" value=\"时间停止组合\">\n                              <span>是否为二级目录：<label class=\"switch-catalog-btn active\"></label></span>\n                              <div class=\"cata-color-wrapper\">\n                                <label>目录颜色：</label>\n                                <div class=\"cata-color-btn\" data-color=\"#666666\" style=\"background: rgb(102, 102, 102);\"></div>\n                              </div>\n                              <button class=\"del-catalog-btn\">删除</button>\n                          </div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">时间停止组合</p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" data-src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/2/30/553788.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" class=\"img-view-ele lazy-img\" img-count=\"8\" lazy=\"loaded\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/202/57/2022/2/30/553788.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" style=\"width: 64px; height: 64px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">无可替代，<span style=\"color: rgb(196, 1, 1);\">需要+6满点火</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.